# Generated mines are reproducible from their seed; keeping them would be checking in a build artefact.
src/RatnaBay.Game/Content/World/Generated/

# butler is fetched by release.ps1 rather than checked in; it is 26 MB of somebody else's binary.
tools/butler/
itch.target

artifacts/

# Clip gifs, but not the mp4s beside them.
#
# A gif of this game runs 9-12 MB where the same seconds are 1.8 MB as h264, and a
# README that costs ten megabytes to scroll past is worse than one with a still in
# it. They regenerate from Docs\scripts\clip-*.rbs and tools\make-clips.ps1 in one
# command, so there is nothing here to lose. Commit one only once it has been cut
# to a size worth downloading.
Docs/clips/*.gif
